  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan Phase II - Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the grant is to meet EITI requirements and support Afghanistan to become an EITI compliant country. Otherobjectives are to help establish a sound EITI implementation mechanism to enhance the Government&apos;s capacity to effectively regulateAfghanistan&apos;s minerals and hydrocarbon resources sector in a transparent manner, fostering private investment in the sector and ensuring that extractive industries benefit those who are most impacted.</narrative>
  </description>
